OL,3,GNEWSALFB named in Met's evidence file
OL,4,Aon Grenfell fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FLondon Fire Brigade (LFB) has confirmed
OL,7,Fit is among those facing possible
OL,8,Fcriminal action over the Grenfell Tower
OL,9,Ffire.
OL,11,FProsecutors were handed an evidence
OL,12,Ffile on 20 organisations and firms and
OL,13,F54 individuals from the Metropolitan
OL,14,FPolice earlier this week.
OL,16,FThe force is seeking charges including
OL,17,Fcorporate manslaughter, gross
OL,18,Fnegligence manslaughter, health and
OL,19,Fsafety offences and fraud-related
OL,20,Foffences relating to the deaths of 72
OL,21,Fpeople in the disaster.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
